  "id": 203987896990648,
  "uuid": "0fc2679b-3b77-4c8e-93e7-7305b4a63068",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "b180499e-fcd8-5c17-a446-bad0f9e8b400",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "5b9b082b-9e32-b506-8f33-106dd2c0d8d5",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "However, driven by a deep passion for societal change, she pursued a Master of Education in Educational Leadership and Management at the Aga Khan University Institute for Educational Development (AKU-IED). ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "While at AKU-IED, Safina thrived. She actively participated in academic and co-curricular activities that broadened her personal and professional development. By participating in international conferences and research cafés, she connected with global scholars and explored innovative solutions to today's pressing educational challenges.  ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "With the steadfast support of her faculty, her thesis, titled \"Principal and Diversity: Exploring Principal-led Initiatives to Develop a Culture that Supports Diverse Students,\" became a cornerstone of her growth. Through her research, she explored the critical role of educational leaders in nurturing inclusive environments for diverse learners, a topic close to her heart. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "One of Safina's most impactful experiences was conducting teaching pedagogy workshops for underprivileged schools in Karachi. \"It was humbling to see how even small changes in teaching methods could make a big difference in students' lives,\" she recalls. These experiences deepened her understanding of the complexities within the education system and further fuelled her passion for reform. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Safina also sought numerous opportunities for growth beyond academics. She contributed to key events such as the Alumni Reunion, International Mathematics Day, Mental Wellbeing Day, and Convocation 2023, and even went on to serve as the captain of the AKU-IED female cricket team. Additionally, her work as a producer for an educational change film helped highlight education's enormous impact and its potential to inspire positive change in both her personal and social life. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "With her newfound knowledge and experiences, Safina aspires to create inclusive and empowering learning environments that cater to the needs of diverse learners. \"Education is the key to unlocking a better sustainable future- not just for individuals but for entire communities,\" she says passionately. \"I want to bring these lessons back to Gilgit Baltistan, and help others discover that power.\" ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
