    "show_share": true,
    "description": "As the sun rose over the mountains of Hunza, Safina would often dream of a life where education could open new doors-not just for her, but for her community. But being a wife and a mother of two young children in Gilgit Baltistan - one of Pakistan's most remote regions - made the route to her dream filled with almost insurmountable challenges.",
